Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- After a check, every page in the 頁面 list shows its number of problems
  ("⚠ 93") and each group the sum ("7　⚠ 99" for Alert), also in the tooltip;
  it follows the Problems panel (re-checks while a page changes, fixes).
- Right-click a page in the list > 檢查這一頁: checks it without opening it.

Tests: smoke 104 (after checking all pages: HotPlate "⚠ 1", the Alert group
"⚠ 99" = 6 + 93; the right-click check: 1), real VS Code 104 (the real list
shows HotPlate "⚠ 1" and keeps it next to the open / current marks), lib
124, probe, panels -- all pass; NO-SAVES. (tools/wb_serve.cpp changed during
the run by another session: the launcher's WARN.)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
